[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5800030358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123767#issuecomment-5800030358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123767","id":5800030358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWbVwlg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T17:52:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:52:21Z","body":"Currently looking into this myself. Looks like at least the `UNTYPED_DECLARATION` warning tries to put the end of the warning range at the beginning of the following line, which breaks the underline-adding logic when the line is the last in the file. With the following GDScript code:\n```gdscript\nextends Node\nvar some_value = 3\n```\nI get:\n```\nvalidate: warning is 2:1 - 3:1\nAdd an underline starting at 1:0 and going to 1:0\n```\nThe line numbers for the underlines are zero-based, so that makes sense. But the column number needs to be clamped to the end of the current (last) line, instead of trying to move on to a non-existent next line.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5800030358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5800304881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123767#issuecomment-5800304881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123767","id":5800304881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWbmg8Q","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T18:11:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:11:01Z","body":"Iirc the GDScript tokenizer or parser inserts a final trailing new line if there isn't one. I guess that might throw of some code.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5800304881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]